<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty flat vs dlr at 2.8650.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty flat vs dlr at 2.8650.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.8650 against the dollar, flat from Wednesday, and at 1.8370 against the mark, down from 1.8360, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
